# GitHub uses the LAST matching pattern for a path, and an unanchored pattern matches at
# any depth. Several unrelated directories in this repo are also named `greenlight` (under
# `.claude/hooks/` and under `torchci/`), so every pattern here is root-anchored to keep
# one area's owners off the others; greenlight/tests/test_codeowners.py fails on one that
# is not.
#
# GitHub reads the first CODEOWNERS file it finds in `.github/`, the root and `docs/`, so
# all three locations are owned here and only the root one exists.

